{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52085","headline":"五言悼姜确（题拟） · 太宗皇帝李世民","name":"五言悼姜确（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凿门初奉卫，伏节始临戎。\n振鳞方跃浪，骋翼正凌风。\n未展六骑术，先亏一篑功。\n防身不足智，狥命有余忠。\n悲骖嘶向路，哀笳咽远空。\n凄凉大树下，流悼满深衷。\n（《册府元龟》卷一四一《帝王部·念良臣》）（按：《全唐诗》卷一录前八句题作《伤辽东战亡》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝李世民","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}